IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SHEN-NUMA.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-CORES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 KV-CACHE-MB         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BANDWIDTH-GBPS-X10  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 L3-HIT-PCT-X10      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SHEN-NUMA.
    IF NUM-CORES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 2486 TO BANDWIDTH-GBPS-X10.
    MOVE 982 TO L3-HIT-PCT-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-CORES.
    WEIGHT 30 BANDWIDTH-GBPS-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
